      "title": "WORKFLOW INSTRUCTIONS",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Load your image.\n2. Describe the change in DESCRIBE YOUR EDIT HERE.\n3. MODE 1: automatic instruction-based editing.\n4. MODE 2: right-click IMAGE, Open in Mask Editor, paint your mask and save it.\nManual mode composites edits only inside your painted mask.\nAutomatic mode chooses edits internally; it does not export an editable AI selection mask.\nPhotographic defaults. No style LoRAs or paid APIs.\nSeed is fixed for repeatable comparisons."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "1. Load your image.\n2. Describe the change in DESCRIBE YOUR EDIT HERE.\n3. MODE 1: automatic instruction-based editing.\n4. MODE 2: right-click IMAGE, Open in Mask Editor, paint your mask and save it.\nManual mode composites edits only inside your painted mask.\nAutomatic mode chooses edits internally; it does not export an editable AI selection mask.\nPhotographic defaults. No style LoRAs or paid APIs.\nSeed is fixed for repeatable comparisons."
      },
      "color": "#26333d",
      "bgcolor": "#1d2730"
